# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the gribsig test only (CMakeLists.txt).
# eccodes 2.45 leaks accessors inside grib_handle_new_from_message when a
# message uses a product template it has no definition for ("Unable to find
# template"): it still returns a handle, and codes_handle_delete does not
# free what the failed template load allocated.  Our handle is RAII-deleted.
leak:grib_handle_new_from_message
